sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Human
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Op as Operator service
  participant W as Worker agent
  participant S as Shared state
  participant T as Target repo / system

  H->>UI: Set global goal, max agents, secrets
  UI->>Op: Save configuration
  H->>UI: Publish task specification
  UI->>Op: Ingest document + link target
  Op->>Op: Decompose into board cards
  Op->>W: Spawn worker (tmux session)
  W->>S: Claim task (In progress)
  loop Until done or blocked
    W->>T: Act (code, email, analysis…)
    W->>W: Validate / self-check
    W->>Op: Stream progress (WebSocket)
  end
  alt Success
    W->>S: Mark Done (succeeded)
    W->>Op: Artifacts + screenshot
  else Needs input
    W->>S: Mark Blocked
    W->>Op: Request human input
    Op->>UI: Notify reviewer
    H->>UI: Provide input
    UI->>Op: Resume worker
  else Failure
    W->>S: Mark Done (failed)
    W->>Op: Failure report
  end
  Op->>UI: Dashboard update
